File: contrib/mfs/mfs_file.c
Line: 538
Function: extend_mem_file
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: Calls realloc(buf[fd], size) without validating fd. If fd is out of range, this reads an out-of-bounds pointer from the buf array, leading to undefined behavior.

